hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15611","Musa ibn Dawud narrated to us, Ibn Lahiah narrated to us, from Yazid ibn Amr, from Abi Abd al-Rahman al-Hubuli, from Abi Fatimah al-Azdi or al-Asadi, he said: The Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said to me: O Abu Fatimah, if you wish to meet me, then increase prostration."
"15612","Hasan ibn Musa narrated to us, Ibn Lahiah narrated to us, al-Harith ibn Yazid narrated to us, from Kathir al-Araj al-Sadafi, he said: I heard Abu Fatimah, while he was with us at Dhu al-Sawari, saying: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: O Abu Fatimah, increase prostration, for there is no Muslim who prostrates to Allah, Blessed and Exalted, a prostration, except Allah, Blessed and Exalted, raises him by it a degree."
"15613","Yahya ibn Ishaq said: Ibn Lahiah informed me, from al-Harith ibn Yazid, from Kathir al-Araj, from Abi Fatimah, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: O Abu Fatimah, increase prostration, for there is no man who prostrates to Allah, Blessed and Exalted, a prostration, except Allah, Blessed and Exalted, raises him by it a degree."
